        <detaileddescription>
<para>Called by <ref refid="namespacePanelGroup_1a54bf0702b5027fc15906ca378515ad0b" kindref="member">PanelGroup::setup()</ref> after chip.init(). Requires a direct GPIO on a timer channel; otherwise logs on DiagSerial and disables the output (no writes at all). On success the pin becomes an output at duty 0, so the zone stays dark until the first matching CTRL_BCAST. </para>
